             "id": "n1010",
             "type": "text",
             "name": "Prompt",
             "content": "Refunds need the same rounding fix. Support saw these this week:\n\n- A customer returned two of three items and got one cent less than they paid for them\n- A refund on a discounted order showed $10.79 in the email and $10.80 in the admin\n- Store credit for a returned gift card came out one cent high\n\nCan you make refunds use the same helper as the cart, add tests for partial refunds, and tell me if anything else still rounds on its own? I would rather know now than find it in next month's reconciliation.",
             "fontFamily": "$ui",
             "fontSize": 13,
             "fill": "$fg",
             "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
             "width": "fill_container",
             "lineHeight": 1.45
